==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|sēbum||tallow, grease; suet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsibm̩/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|se|bum}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|+|seba}}

# {{lb|en|physiology}} A thick oily substance, secreted by the [[sebaceous gland]]s of the skin, that consists of [[fat]], [[keratin]] and cellular debris.
